msgstr ""
"Chat API (similar a la `Chat Completion API "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/chat/create>`__ de OpenAI) "
"permite conversaciones de múltiples rondas."

#: ../../source/models/model_abilities/chat.rst:27
msgid ""
"The Generate API (like OpenAI's legacy `Completions API "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/completions/create>`__) "
"allows you to generate text based on a text prompt."
msgstr ""
"La API de generación (similar a la `Completions API "
"<https://platform.openai.com/docs/api-reference/completions/create>`__ de "
"OpenAI) le permite generar texto a partir de un prompt textual."

